<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.98     loss	 $4.18</p>
<p> Net    profit	  207,000     loss     936,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,091,000		3,731,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 211,200		  224,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 loss includes $5.02/share charge related to accounting change for MD-11 trijet. Excluding this charge, Q4 earnings were $0.84 a share.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $3.64     loss	 $1.83</p>
<p> Net     profit	 788,000     loss     416,000</p>
<p> Revs		  13,834,000	     14,332,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 216,400		  227,100</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1995 earnings include $4.95 a share loss related to MD-11 accounting charge. Excluding charge, 1995 operating earnings were $3.12 a share.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
